  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Squirrel_House?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/27/Squirrel_House_Stage_4.png/revision/latest?cb=20200707051508\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Squirrel house\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel house\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"280\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Squirrel house</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animal-shelters-33414\" title=\"Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal Shelter</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 62</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 45,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Houses </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Squirrel</span><span title=\"Squirrel(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/squirrel-34000\" title=\"Squirrel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/41/Squirrel.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20200707053020\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> x8</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>squirrel house</b> is a shelter for <a href=\"/wiki/squirrel-34000\" title=\"Squirrel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">squirrels</a>. It is unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 62.\n</p><p>It can be grown to shelter more squirrels.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Growing </b></span></h3>\n<p>The growth cycle of the squirrel house depends on how many peanut pods have been brought to the squirrel house by the squirrels:\n</p>\n<ul><li>when squirrels have collected 5,500 peanut pods from the <a href=\"/wiki/peanut-bush-33999\" title=\"Peanut Bush\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">peanut bushes</a> the house gets another set of doors and can hold two more squirrels.</li>\n<li>the same happens when squirrels have collected 80,000 pods.</li>\n<li>the same happens when squirrels have collected 270,000 pods. The tree stops growing then.</li></ul>\n<p>As the house grows its overall appearance changes:\n</p><p><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/cd/Squirrel_House_Stage_1.png/revision/latest?cb=20200707051255\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel House Stage 1\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"76\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fb/Squirrel_House_Stage_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20200707051334\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel House Stage 2\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c2/Squirrel_House_Stage_3.png/revision/latest?cb=20200707051415\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel House Stage 3\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"116\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/27/Squirrel_House_Stage_4.png/revision/latest?cb=20200707051508\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel House Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"140\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<p>The squirrel house can be purchased in the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a> for 45,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>. <span>Shop</span><span title=\"Shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>\n</p><p>Players can only have one squirrel house.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting</b></span></h3>\n<p>The house itself does not produce anything: squirrels produce <a href=\"/wiki/peanuts-33962\" title=\"Peanuts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">peanuts</a> within the squirrel house. Peanuts are produced instantaneously once 300 peanut pods have been brought to the house. This takes approximately 5 hours.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Did You Know?</b></span></h3>\n<p>When the Squirrel House was originally introduced 350,000 peanut pods were required to earn the 3-start mastery.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-animal-shelters-6565\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal Shelters</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/alpaca-house-36823\" title=\"Alpaca House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Alpaca House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/beehive-tree-15804\" title=\"Beehive Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beehive Tree Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bird-house-35210\" title=\"Bird House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bird House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"142\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bunny-house-12523\" title=\"Bunny House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bunny House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cat-house-2711\" title=\"Cat House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cat House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chicken-coop-2715\" title=\"Chicken Coop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chicken Coop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cow-pasture-2717\" title=\"Cow Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cow Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/dog-house-2713\" title=\"Dog House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Dog House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/donkey-stable-9426\" title=\"Donkey Stable\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Donkey Stable\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/goat-yard-2723\" title=\"Goat Yard\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Goat Yard\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/guinea-pig-house-35051\" title=\"Guinea Pig House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Guinea Pig House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/horse-stable-2709\" title=\"Horse Stable\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Horse Stable\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/kitten-house-18341\" title=\"Kitten House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Kitten House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/lamb-pasture-36754\" title=\"Lamb Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lamb Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"58\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/pig-pen-2719\" title=\"Pig Pen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pig Pen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/puppy-house-18339\" title=\"Puppy House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Puppy House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/sheep-pasture-2721\" title=\"Sheep Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sheep Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/squirrel-house-33971\" title=\"Squirrel House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel House Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"140\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/buildings-3577\" title=\"Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Buildings</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831071132\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.102 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 654/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7782/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1848/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function